# Repository_Management#1520: SPEC.md's change-log table is left unpadded on
# purpose. Prettier pads markdown table cells to the width of the widest row,
# so a single new change-log row would rewrite every other row -- turning a
# one-line addition into a whole-table diff that conflicts with every
# concurrent pull request. That is the exact failure #1520 removes.
#
# The table also carries <!-- prettier-ignore-start/end --> markers, which are
# the narrower mechanism and are sufficient on their own in Tools. They are NOT
# sufficient here: with them in place `prettier --check SPEC.md` still reports
# this file. The acceptance test is `prettier --check SPEC.md`, not the
# presence of either mechanism.
